---
import "../styles/global.css";

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ReadMoreButton from "../components/ReadMoreButton.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="About">
  <main>
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 mb-32">
      <h1
        class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl py-14 lg:py-20"
      >
        About
      </h1>
      <div class="text-[1.1rem] leading-8">
        <p>
          My name is Karo, and I am a Finnish camper enthusiast. I run this
          website with the help of my family.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
          We are former van lifers who traveled and lived in a self-converted
          camper van. Nowadays, we travel with our caravan, our kids, and our
          dog. We have traveled by motorhome in North America and Australia, and
          by camper throughout Europe. We look forward to many more camping
          trips in Finland and around the world.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
          The goal of this website is to help you plan and enjoy a great camping
          trip in our northern homeland. Finland is an excellent destination for
          a road trip, offering beautiful nature, peaceful surroundings, and
          plenty of space. Whether you travel with a motorhome, camper van,
          caravan, or prefer camping in a tent or hammock, I hope you will find
          useful information here.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
          I hope this website helps you plan your adventure. If you have any
          questions, suggestions, or feedback, feel free to contact me at
          hello@camperfinland.com.
        </p>
      </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
